{
    "background_story": "Thalia was a brilliant and meticulous jeweler known for her exquisite attention to detail. She spent years perfecting her craft, and her small workshop became a haven for those seeking one-of-a-kind pieces. Thalia's specialty was working with precious metals, and she took great pride in measuring each ounce of gold, silver, and platinum with precision. Her most famous creation, a delicate necklace featuring a rare, ounce-sized diamond, was showcased in a prominent gallery and earned her international acclaim. Thalia's dedication to her craft and her ability to coax beauty from even the smallest ounce of material made her a master in her field, sought after by collectors and connoisseurs worldwide.",
